<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sugen a UBS buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sugen a UBS buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Tim Wilson said it started coverage of Sugen Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- He noted company's lead product SU101 for refractory brain, lung, prostate and ovarian cancer is in phase four I/II trials and has already generated preliminary efficacy data.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 10-3/8.</p>
</text>
